### Open this file in VS Code with the "REST Client" extension (humao.rest-client)
### and click "Send Request" above each block.
### Run the two LOGIN requests first: the tokens are saved automatically and used below.

@base = http://localhost:8080
@adminToken = {{adminLogin.response.body.token}}
@userToken = {{userLogin.response.body.token}}

### ======================= AUTH =======================

### Register a normal user -> 201 + token (run once; a second time gives 409)
POST {{base}}/api/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "fan@example.com",
  "password": "supersecret"
}

### LOGIN as user -> 200 + token
# @name userLogin
POST {{base}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "fan@example.com",
  "password": "supersecret"
}

### LOGIN as the seeded admin -> 200 + token
# @name adminLogin
POST {{base}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "admin@tixrush.local",
  "password": "admin12345"
}

### Wrong password -> 401
POST {{base}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "admin@tixrush.local",
  "password": "nope-nope"
}

### ======================= EVENTS: public reads =======================

### List events (no token needed)
GET {{base}}/api/events

### Get one -> 200 (or 404 if it doesn't exist)
GET {{base}}/api/events/1

### Health check
GET {{base}}/actuator/health

### ======================= EVENTS: admin only =======================

### Create WITHOUT a token -> 401
POST {{base}}/api/events
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Rush Hour Live in KL",
  "venue": "Bukit Jalil National Stadium",
  "startsAt": "2027-03-20T12:00:00Z",
  "saleStartsAt": "2027-01-10T02:00:00Z",
  "totalTickets": 5000
}

### Create as USER -> 403
POST {{base}}/api/events
Authorization: Bearer {{userToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Rush Hour Live in KL",
  "venue": "Bukit Jalil National Stadium",
  "startsAt": "2027-03-20T12:00:00Z",
  "saleStartsAt": "2027-01-10T02:00:00Z",
  "totalTickets": 5000
}

### Create as ADMIN -> 201
POST {{base}}/api/events
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Rush Hour Live in KL",
  "venue": "Bukit Jalil National Stadium",
  "startsAt": "2027-03-20T12:00:00Z",
  "saleStartsAt": "2027-01-10T02:00:00Z",
  "totalTickets": 5000
}

### Invalid body as ADMIN -> 400 with an "errors" map
POST {{base}}/api/events
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "",
  "venue": "Somewhere",
  "startsAt": "2020-01-01T00:00:00Z",
  "saleStartsAt": "2019-01-01T00:00:00Z",
  "totalTickets": -5
}

### Update as ADMIN -> 200 (change the id to one that exists)
PUT {{base}}/api/events/1
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Rush Hour Live in KL (Night 2)",
  "venue": "Bukit Jalil National Stadium",
  "startsAt": "2027-03-21T12:00:00Z",
  "saleStartsAt": "2027-01-10T02:00:00Z"
}

### ======================= BUYING (any logged-in user) =======================
### Change the event id to one that exists. strategy = naive | pessimistic | optimistic

### Buy one ticket -> 201, or 409 when sold out
POST {{base}}/api/events/1/purchases?strategy=pessimistic
Authorization: Bearer {{userToken}}

### Buy without a token -> 401
POST {{base}}/api/events/1/purchases?strategy=pessimistic

### Buy with the Redis counter (version 4) -> 201 / 409
POST {{base}}/api/events/1/purchases?strategy=redis
Authorization: Bearer {{userToken}}

### Send this 6 times quickly: the 6th returns 429 + Retry-After (limit = 5 per minute)
POST {{base}}/api/events/1/purchases?strategy=redis
Authorization: Bearer {{userToken}}

### v4 complete: Redis + RabbitMQ -> 202 Accepted {reservationId, status: QUEUED, expiresAt}
# @name queueBuy
POST {{base}}/api/events/1/purchases?strategy=queue
Authorization: Bearer {{userToken}}
Idempotency-Key: demo-click-1

### Same Idempotency-Key again -> same answer, header "Idempotent-Replayed: true", no 2nd ticket
### (change "demo-click-1" to buy another one)
POST {{base}}/api/events/1/purchases?strategy=queue
Authorization: Bearer {{userToken}}
Idempotency-Key: demo-click-1

### ======================= MY ORDERS (any logged-in user) =======================

### My latest orders (PENDING_PAYMENT / PAID / EXPIRED / CONFIRMED)
GET {{base}}/api/orders/mine
Authorization: Bearer {{userToken}}

### One order (404 for a moment right after buying: the worker is still creating it)
GET {{base}}/api/orders/{{queueBuy.response.body.reservationId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{userToken}}

### Pay before the hold runs out -> 200 PAID (a 2nd time -> 409)
POST {{base}}/api/orders/{{queueBuy.response.body.reservationId}}/pay
Authorization: Bearer {{userToken}}

### Unknown strategy -> 400
POST {{base}}/api/events/1/purchases?strategy=magic
Authorization: Bearer {{userToken}}

### ======================= BENCHMARK ADMIN =======================

### Stats: sold / left / oversold -> 200
GET {{base}}/api/admin/events/1/stats
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

### Reset: delete this event's orders and refill stock -> 204
POST {{base}}/api/admin/events/1/reset
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

### Round-trip time to Redis (Upstash)
GET {{base}}/api/admin/redis/ping
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

### Optimistic retry counter (Micrometer metric)
GET {{base}}/actuator/metrics/tixrush.purchase.optimistic.retries
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

### Delete as ADMIN -> 204
DELETE {{base}}/api/events/1
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
